{"content":[{"c":["BREASTPIECE*, BREASTPLATE*"],"sourceClass":"h1","t":"p"},{"c":["1. Part of the ceremonial garment of the high priest (",{"href":"?bref=Exod.25.7","r":"Exod.25.7","rawR":"Exod.25.7","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Exod.25.7","value":"Exod.25.7"}],"t":"ref","v":"Ex 25:7"},"). ",{"c":["See"],"sourceClass":"ital","t":"span"}," ",{"href":"?item=PriestsandLevites_Article_TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","id":"PriestsandLevites_Article_TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","rawId":"PriestsandLevites_Article_TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","t":"link","v":"Priests and Levites"},"."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"},{"c":["2. Piece of armor worn to protect the chest. The word is used figuratively in several passages. ",{"href":"?bref=Isa.59.17","r":"Isa.59.17","rawR":"Isa.59.17","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Isa.59.17","value":"Isa.59.17"}],"t":"ref","v":"Isaiah 59:17"}," says that God put on righteousness as a breastplate or body armor as he prepared to take vengeance on his enemies. The apostle Paul exhorted Christians to wear a breastplate of righteousness in order to stand against the devil (",{"href":"?bref=Eph.6.14","r":"Eph.6.14","rawR":"Eph.6.14","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Eph.6.14","value":"Eph.6.14"}],"t":"ref","v":"Eph 6:14"},") and a breastplate of faith and love as they await Christ’s return (",{"href":"?bref=1Thes.5.8","r":"1Thes.5.8","rawR":"1Thes.5.8","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"1Thes.5.8","value":"1Thes.5.8"}],"t":"ref","v":"1 Thes 5:8"},")."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"},{"c":[{"c":["See also"],"sourceClass":"ital","t":"span"}," ",{"href":"?item=ArmorandWeapons_Article_TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","id":"ArmorandWeapons_Article_TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","rawId":"ArmorandWeapons_Article_TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","t":"link","v":"Armor and Weapons"},"."],"sourceClass":"list-text","t":"p"}],"format":"bsb-study-dictionary-v2","id":"BreastpieceBreastplate","provenance":{"archiveSha256":"10758ea00dbea7540f9337e43e59c8e4000295c1261e3426bab6f31c31dcff5b","release":"1.6","sourceCitationReferences":[{"anchorText":"Ex 25:7","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Exod.25.7","rawQueryValue":"Exod.25.7","sourceRefExact":"Exod.25.7"},{"anchorText":"Isaiah 59:17","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Isa.59.17","rawQueryValue":"Isa.59.17","sourceRefExact":"Isa.59.17"},{"anchorText":"Eph 6:14","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Eph.6.14","rawQueryValue":"Eph.6.14","sourceRefExact":"Eph.6.14"},{"anchorText":"1 Thes 5:8","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=1Thes.5.8","rawQueryValue":"1Thes.5.8","sourceRefExact":"1Thes.5.8"}],"sourceItemFragmentSha256":"7e5d0971c5b3b43169678c97e2dfb0d6a45943caef88885a42c625fc2272a6b6","sourceItemName":"BreastpieceBreastplate","sourceItemOrder":407,"sourceMember":"Articles/B.xml","supplementPointersNotIncludedAsContent":[]},"sourceAttributes":{"name":"BreastpieceBreastplate","product":"TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","typename":"Article"},"sourceTitleExact":"Breastpiece*, Breastplate*","title":"Breastpiece*, Breastplate*","version":"v2-a101d843a2f0cd3fc0c6"}